{"id":2130,"date":"2024-03-24T09:20:17","date_gmt":"2024-03-24T13:20:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bhide.net\/wordpress_files\/index.php\/book-cover-and-title-done\/"},"modified":"2024-03-24T09:20:17","modified_gmt":"2024-03-24T13:20:17","slug":"book-cover-and-title-done","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/index.php\/book-cover-and-title-done\/","title":{"rendered":"Book Cover and Title Done."},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After driving myself and many friends crazy, I&#8217;ve finally converged on a book title and cover.<br \/>OK, so it&#8217;s not War and Peace or In Search of Excellence, but it&#8217;s not intended to be a pop, mass book.<br \/>The &#8220;Venturing Beyond the Known&#8221; is a multi-sided (if too subtle) pun plus a bow to the Knightian uncertainty that&#8217;s my point of departure.\u00a0(I go very far from the original)<br \/>And Hokusai waves, I&#8217;m told are now hip..<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/bookcover-march-2024.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-id=\"2126\" class=\"wp-image-2126\" src=\"http:\/\/localhost:10004\/wp-content\/uploads\/DALL\u00b7E-2023-02-06-15.43.49-formidable-barriers-and-forgotten-pathways.pngwp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/bookcover-march-2024-784x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"648\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>After driving myself and many friends crazy, I&#8217;ve finally converged on a book title and cover.OK, so it&#8217;s not War<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","st